vements.\n','Property Assignment Movement Group','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1129,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Previous Causality Movement Group','portal_types/Previous Causality Movement Group',34,'Previous Causality Movement Group','  The purpose of MovementGroup is to define how movements are grouped,\n  and how values are updated from simulation movements.\n','Previous Causality Movement Group','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1130,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Person Module','portal_types/Person Module',34,'Person Module','Holds person objects','Person Module','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1131,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Person','portal_types/Person',34,'Person','Persons capture the contact information (ex. name, phone number) and the relation between entities (ex. who is assigned to which function and which organisation). Persons are supported by a standard validation workflow.','Person','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:51:51','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1132,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Parent Explanation Movement Group','portal_types/Parent Explanation Movement Group',34,'Parent Explanation Movement Group','  The purpose of MovementGroup is to define how movements are grouped,\n  and how values are updated from simulation movements.\n','Parent Explanation Movement Group','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1133,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Parent Delivery Property Movement Group','portal_types/Parent Delivery Property Movement Group',34,'Parent Delivery Property Movement Group','  The purpose of MovementGroup is to define how movements are grouped,\n  and how values are updated from simulation movements.\n','Parent Delivery Property Movement Group','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1134,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Organisation Module','portal_types/Organisation Module',34,'Organisation Module','Holds organisation objects','Organisation Module','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1135,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Organisation','portal_types/Organisation',34,'Organisation','Organisations capture the contact information (ex. name, phone number) and their classification (ex. site, group, function etc.). Organisations are supported by a standard validation workflow.','Organisation','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:51:51','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1137,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Order Movement Group','portal_types/Order Movement Group',34,'Order Movement Group','  The purpose of MovementGroup is to define how movements are grouped,\n  and how values are updated from simulation movements.\n','Order Movement Group','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1138,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Order Builder','portal_types/Order Builder',34,'Order Builder','    Delivery Builder objects allow to gather multiple Simulation Movements\n    into a single Delivery. \n\n    The initial quantity property of the Delivery Line is calculated by\n    summing quantities of related Simulation Movements.\n\n    Delivery Builders are called for example whenever an order is confirmed.\n    They are also called globaly in order to gather any confirmed or above \n    Simulation Movement which was not associated to any Delivery Line. \n    Such movements are called orphaned Simulation Movements.\n\n    Delivery Builder objects are provided with a set a parameters to achieve \n    their goal:\n\n    A path definition: source, destination, etc. which defines the general \n    kind of movements it applies.\n\n    simulation_select_method which defines how to query all Simulation \n    Movements which meet certain criteria (including the above path path \n    definition).\n\n    collect_order_list which defines how to group selected movements \n    according to gathering rules.\n\n    delivery_select_method which defines how to select existing Delivery \n    which may eventually be updated with selected simulation movements.\n\n    delivery_module, delivery_type and delivery_line_type which define the \n    module and portal types for newly built Deliveries and Delivery Lines.\n\n    Delivery Builders can also be provided with optional parameters to \n    restrict selection to a given root Applied Rule caused by a single Order\n    or to Simulation Movements related to a limited set of existing \n    Deliveries.\n','Order Builder','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1139,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/OOo Document','portal_types/OOo Document',34,'OOo Document','','OOo Document','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1140,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Notification Message Module','portal_types/Notification Message Module',34,'Notification Message Module','','Notification Message Module','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1141,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Notification Message','portal_types/Notification Message',34,'Notification Message','Messages that can be seen by the user and that appear depending upon the actions of the user. They can be warning, information or error messages','Notification Message','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1142,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Nested Line Movement Group','portal_types/Nested Line Movement Group',34,'Nested Line Movement Group','  The purpose of MovementGroup is to define how movements are grouped,\n  and how values are updated from simulation movements.\n','Nested Line Movement Group','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1143,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Monthly Range Movement Group','portal_types/Monthly Range Movement Group',34,'Monthly Range Movement Group','This movement group gathers movements which their start_date and stop_date are in the same month.','Monthly Range Movement Group','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1144,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Mapped Property','portal_types/Mapped Property',34,'Mapped Property','Mapped Property object describes how properties or categories are mapped from simulation movements to delivery documents, eg. use source as destination, use destination as source, use quantity as -quantity, etc.','Mapped Property','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1145,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Link','portal_types/Link',34,'Link','A URL allows to represent in a standard way coordinates such as web sites, emails, ftp sites, etc.','Link','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1146,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Invoice Movement Group','portal_types/Invoice Movement Group',34,'Invoice Movement Group','This movement group is used to collect movements related to the same invoice. This movement group should be used in delivery level.','Invoice Movement Group','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1147,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Image','portal_types/Image',34,'Image','Image type documents in ERP5. Many formats are supported','Image','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1148,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Geographical Location','portal_types/Geogr