Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1154,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Embedded File','portal_types/Embedded File',34,'Embedded File','An embedded file (which can act as an image as well).','Embedded File','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1155,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Email','portal_types/Email',34,'Email','An Email object can contain a link to an online resource.','Email','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1156,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/ERP5 Login','portal_types/ERP5 Login',34,'ERP5 Login','','ERP5 Login','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1157,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Delivery Type','portal_types/Delivery Type',34,'Delivery Type','Delivery Type is a Base Type which allows its portal type instances to define a list of ledger to which they can belong to.','Delivery Type','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1160,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Delivery Causality Assignment Movement Group','portal_types/Delivery Causality Assignment Movement Group',34,'Delivery Causality Assignment Movement Group','Like CausalityAssignmentMovementGroup, but using the delivery relation of\nsimulation movements instead of order relation. This is intended to be used in deeper level of simulation tree.\n','Delivery Causality Assignment Movement Group','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1161,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Delivery Builder','portal_types/Delivery Builder',34,'Delivery Builder','XXX Deprecated. It must be deleted. 2 new portal types replace it: Generated Delivery Builder and Simulated Delivery Builder\n\nDelivery Builder objects allow to gather multiple Simulation Movements into\na single Delivery. The initial quantity property of the Delivery Line is\ncalculated by summing quantities of related Simulation Movements.\n\nDelivery Builders are called for example whenever an order is confirmed.\nThey are also called globally in order to gather any confirmed or above\nSimulation Movement which was not associated to any Delivery Line.  Such\nmovements are called orphaned Simulation Movements.\n\nDelivery Builder objects are provided with a set a parameters to achieve\ntheir goal:\n\nA path definition: source, destination, etc. which defines the general\nkind of movements it applies.\n\nsimulation_select_method which defines how to query all Simulation\nMovements which meet certain criteria (including the above path path\ndefinition).\n\ncollect_order_list which defines how to group selected movements according\nto gathering rules.\n\ndelivery_select_method which defines how to select existing Delivery  which\nmay eventually be updated with selected simulation movements.\n\ndelivery_module, delivery_type and delivery_line_type which define the\nmodule and portal types for newly built Deliveries and Delivery Lines.\n\nDelivery Builders can also be provided with optional parameters to\nrestrict selection to a given root Applied Rule caused by a single Order or\nto Simulation Movements related to a limited set of existing Deliveries.','Delivery Builder','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:51:51','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1162,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Day Movement Group','portal_types/Day Movement Group',34,'Day Movement Group','  This movement group is used to group movements which belong to the same day\n','Day Movement Group','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1163,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Currency Module','portal_types/Currency Module',34,'Currency Module',' Holds Accounting Transaction objects','Currency Module','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1164,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Currency Exchange Line','portal_types/Currency Exchange Line',34,'Currency Exchange Line','This line can define the value of a currency towards another currency','Currency Exchange Line','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1165,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Currency Exchange Cell','portal_types/Currency Exchange Cell',34,'Currency Exchange Cell','Une ligne tarifaire.','Currency Exchange Cell','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:20','2020-04-09 10:52:12'),(1166,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Currency','portal_types/Currency',34,'Currency','A Currency is a resource which can be credited or debited on general ledger accounts. It defines currency inf