lver Processes','Solver Process Tool','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:51','2020-04-09 10:52:15'),(3735,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Solver Process','portal_types/Solver Process',34,'Solver Process','A Solver Process is a document which stored a collection of solver decisions and provides a persistency area to solvers which are in charge of implementing the decision.','Solver Process','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:51','2020-04-09 10:52:15'),(3736,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Solver Decision','portal_types/Solver Decision',34,'Solver Decision','A Solver Decision defines which delivery movements are solved using which solvers. Solver Dcision will support all property sheets which are supported also by a Target Solver, so that it can hold decision information.\r\n','Solver Decision','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:51','2020-04-09 10:52:15'),(3737,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Net Converted Quantity Divergence Tester','portal_types/Net Converted Quantity Divergence Tester',34,'Net Converted Quantity Divergence Tester','Net Converted Quantity Divergence Testers can be used to test net converted quantity, taking into account margins and rounding. All configuration properties of divergence testers are stored at instance level in order to simplify their historization at rule level.','Net Converted Quantity Divergence Tester','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:50:51','2020-04-09 10:52:15'),(3738,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase'