e','Returned Purchase Packing List Lines are part of returned purchase packing lists and bear the different product or service references that are returned by the company.','Returned Purchase Packing List Line','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:51:51','2020-04-09 10:52:16'),(5920,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Returned Purchase Packing List Cell','portal_types/Returned Purchase Packing List Cell',34,'Returned Purchase Packing List Cell','A Returned Purchase Packing List Cell specifies a price and a quantity for each variation of a resource in a delivery line.','Returned Purchase Packing List Cell','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:51:51','2020-04-09 10:52:16'),(5921,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Returned Purchase Packing List','portal_types/Returned Purchase Packing List',34,'Returned Purchase Packing List','Returned Purchase Packing List allows for keeping a trace of goods or services which have been delivered to a customer. It can track how delivered goods or services differ from ordered goods or services. A single order may therefore result in multiple packing lists. Packing Lists directly impact the inventory. It is essential to understand that once an order has been confirmed, it should never be modified since it defines a contractual relation. Changes to initial expectations shall be entered into Packing Lists, not in Orders. The impact of changes shall be calculated automatically through so-called \"Solvers\" which postpone backordered goods, accept the changes to initial expectations, etc. based on standard or custom business rules.','Returned Purchase Packing List','ERP5 Delivery Type','Delivery Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:51:51','2020-04-09 10:52:16'),(5922,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Returned Purchase Order Module','portal_types/Returned Purchase Order Module',34,'Returned Purchase Order Module','Holds Returned Purchase Orders','Returned Purchase Order Module','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:51:51','2020-04-09 10:52:16'),(5923,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Returned Purchase Order Line','portal_types/Returned Purchase Order Line',34,'Returned Purchase Order Line','Purchase order lines are part of purchase orders and bear the different product or service references that have been purchased by the company.','Returned Purchase Order Line','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:51:51','2020-04-09 10:52:16'),(5924,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Returned Purchase Order Cell','portal_types/Returned Purchase Order Cell',34,'Returned Purchase Order Cell','A DeliveryCell allows to define specific quantities for each variation of a resource in a delivery line.','Returned Purchase Order Cell','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:51:51','2020-04-09 10:52:16'),(5925,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Returned Purchase Order','portal_types/Returned Purchase Order',34,'Returned Purchase Order','','Returned Purchase Order','ERP5 Delivery Type','Delivery Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:51:51','2020-04-09 10:52:16'),(5926,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Purchase Trade Condition Module','portal_types/Purchase Trade Condition Module',34,'Purchase Trade Condition Module','Holds Purchase Trade Conditions','Purchase Trade Condition Module','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:51:51','2020-04-09 10:52:16'),(5927,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Purchase Trade Condition','portal_types/Purchase Trade Condition',34,'Purchase Trade Condition','Purchase trade conditions are documents that gather all the details of a standard purchase order, such as the shipment or payment mode, the tax or discount behaviour. A purchase trade condition can be applied to a purchase order, and in this case, the information borne by the purchase trade condition will be imported to the purchase order. This is practical for the user, because it allows not to loose time typing the same information again and again.','Purchase Trade Condition','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:51:51','2020-04-09 10:52:16'),(5928,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Purchase Packing List Module','portal_types/Purchase Packing List Module',34,'Purchase Packing List Module','Holds Purchase Packing Lists','Purchase Packing List Module','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:51:51','2020-04-09 10:52:16'),(5929,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Purchase Packing List Line','portal_types/Purchase Packing List Line',34,'Purchase Packing List Line','Purchase packing list lines are part of purchase packing lists, and bear the different references that have been ordered. For each product/service reference there will be a purchase packing list line.','Purchase Packing List Line','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:51:51','2020-04-09 10:52:16'),(5930,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Purchase Packing List Cell','portal_types/Purchase Packing List Cell',34,'Purchase Packing List Cell','Une ligne tarifaire.','Purchase Packing List Cell','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:51:51','2020-04-09 10:52:16'),(5931,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Purchase Packing List','portal_types/Purchase Packing List',34,'Purchase Packing List','Purchase Packing List allows for keeping a trace of goods or services which have been received from a supplier. It can track how received goods or services differ from ordered goods or services. A single order may therefore result in multiple packing lists. Packing Lists directly impact the inventory. It is essential to understand that once an order has been confirmed, it should never be modified since it defines a contractual relation. Changes to initial expectations shall be entered into Packing Lists, not in Orders. The impact of changes shall be calculated automatically through so-called \"Solvers\" which postpone backordered goods, accept the changes to initial expectations, etc. based on standard or custom business rules.','Purchase Packing List','ERP5 Delivery Type','Delivery Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:51:51','2020-04-09 10:52:16'),(5932,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Purchase Order Module','portal_types/Purchase Order Module',34,'Purchase Order Module','Holds Purchase Orders','Purchase Order Module','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:51:51','2020-04-09 10:52:16'),(5933,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Purchase Order Line','portal_types/Purchase Order Line',34,'Purchase Order Line','Purchase order lines are part of purchase orders and bear the different product or service references that have been purchased by the company.','Purchase Order Line','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:51:51','2020-04-09 10:52:16'),(5934,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Purchase Order Cell','portal_types/Purchase Order Cell',34,'Purchase Order Cell','A DeliveryCell allows to define specific quantities for each variation of a resource in a delivery line.','Purchase Order Cell','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:51:51','2020-04-09 10:52:16'),(5935,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Purchase Order','portal_types/Purchase Order',34,'Purchase Order','When a user of ERP5 wants to materialize a purchase that has been done by his company, he or she should use a purchase order. Purchase orders contain some general information about the buyer and the seller, and contain purchase order lines.','Purchase Order','ERP5 Delivery Type','Delivery Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:51:51','2020-04-09 10:52:16'),(5936,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Payment Condition','portal_types/Payment Condition',34,'Payment Condition','Payment conditions can be either on a sale/purchase order or on a sale/purchase trade condition document. Payment condition describes the payment conditions that will be applied to an order, such as the payment mode, the term, etc..','Payment Condition','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:51:51','2020-04-09 10:52:16'),(5937,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Order Root Simulation Rule','portal_types/Order Root Simulation Rule',34,'Order Root Simulation Rule','An ERP5 Rule...','Order Root Simulation Rule','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:51:51','2020-04-09 10:52:16'),(5938,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Order','portal_types/Order',34,'Order','This portal type is an abstract portal type, so that newTempOrder calls can succeed; one should never have to use this portal type for persistent objects.','Order','ERP5 Delivery Type','Delivery Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:51:51','2020-04-09 10:52:16'),(5939,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Inventory Report Module','portal_types/Inventory Report Module',34,'Inventory Report Module','','Inventory Report Module','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:51:51','2020-04-09 10:52:16'),(5940,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Inventory Report Line','portal_types/Inventory Report Line',34,'Inventory Report Line','An inventory line can be found in inventory documents, and bears the available stock of a certain product reference. There will be one inventory line for each product reference of the inventory.','Inventory Report Line','ERP5 Base Type','Base Type',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2020-04-09 10:51:51','2020-04-09 10:52:16'),(5941,10,'ERP5TypeTestCase','ERP5TypeTestCase','/erp5/portal_types/Inventory Report','portal_types/Inventory Report',34,'Inventory Report','','Inventory Report','ERP5 Base Type','Base Typ