ring properties, with configuration caps equivalences. All configuration properties of divergence testers are stored at instance level in order to simplify their historization at rule level.'),(3731,'An abstract Portal Type which is useful to generate Solvers (ex. Target Solvers) and to keep all common properties in a central place. Solver properties include various user interface information, configuration forms, and possibly properties which help to find out incompatible divergence resolution decisions.'),(3734,'Solver Process Tool contains Solver Processes'),(3735,'A Solver Process is a document which stored a collection of solver decisions and provides a persistency area to solvers which are in charge of implementing the decision.'),(3736,'A Solver Decision defines which delivery movements are solved using which solvers. Solver Dcision will support all property sheets which are supported also by a Target Solver, so that it can hold decision information.'),(3737,'Net Converted Quantity Divergence Testers can be used to test net converted quantity, taking into account margins and rounding. All configuration properties of divergence testers are stored at instance level in order to simplify their historization at rule level.'),(3738,'Float Divergence Testers can be used to test float properties, taking into account margins and rounding. All configuration properties of divergence testers are stored at instance level in order to simplify their historization at rule level.'),(3740,'Category Membership Divergence Testers can be used to test category memberships. All configuration properties of divergence testers are stored at instance level in order to simplify their historisation at rule level.'),(3743,'Properties for the Specialise Divergence Tester portal type.'),(3747,'erp5_simulation'),(3748,'erp5_simulation This business templates contains abstract tools which are required by all business templates based on the concept of Simulation.'),(3767,'Start'),(3773,'Submit